{"root":"abu","ipa":"/abu/","core":"灰，灰烬；指燃烧后留下的粉末状物质，也常用于形容颜色（灰色）。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/abu/","zh":"灰，灰烬","phrases":[{"t":"abu rokok","zh":"烟灰"},{"t":"abu gosok","zh":"草木灰（常用于洗涤）"},{"t":"warna abu-abu","zh":"灰色"}],"examples":[{"t":"Sisa pembakaran kayu itu menjadi abu.","zh":"木头燃烧后的剩余物变成了灰烬。"},{"t":"Dia memakai baju berwarna abu-abu.","zh":"他穿着一件灰色的衣服。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"abu","ipa":"/abu/","zh":"灰，灰烬","phrase":{"t":"abu vulkanik","zh":"火山灰"},"example":{"t":"Abu vulkanik menutupi desa itu.","zh":"火山灰覆盖了那个村庄。"}},{"w":"abu-abu","ipa":"/abu-abu/","zh":"灰色的；模糊的，不明确的","phrase":{"t":"daerah abu-abu","zh":"灰色地带"},"example":{"t":"Aturan ini masih abu-abu.","zh":"这条规则仍然很模糊。"}},{"w":"mengabu","ipa":"/məŋabu/","zh":"变成灰，像灰一样","phrase":{"t":"mengabu menjadi debu","zh":"化为灰烬"},"example":{"t":"Semua dokumen itu mengabu setelah terbakar.","zh":"所有文件在烧毁后都化为了灰烬。"}},{"w":"keabuan","ipa":"/kəabuan/","zh":"带灰色的，灰蒙蒙的","phrase":{"t":"langit keabuan","zh":"灰蒙蒙的天空"},"example":{"t":"Warna cat itu tampak keabuan.","zh":"那油漆的颜色看起来带点灰色。"}}],"derSlugs":["abu","abu-abu","mengabu","keabuan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:45:48.258Z","src":"base"}